Scope note

This license covers the code in this repository — the reader application under
src/ and the content pipeline under pipeline/.

It does not cover the course material that the pipeline consumes. The lesson
pages, figures and interpreter source files of Ben-Gurion University's
"Principles of Programming Languages" course, and any Hebrew translation
derived from them, are the property of their respective authors. None of that
material is distributed in this repository; it is fetched from the course's own
public repositories at setup time and generated locally. Nothing here grants
any right to it.
